{
  "$comment": "Cases of the context-fullness rule, run by both copies: the sidebar's (desktop/src/lib/contextOccupancy.ts) and agent access's (desktop/src-tauri/src/ops/context.rs). turns are one agent's turns in file order; compaction is the agent's newest sized compaction marker, if any.",
